## Objective
- Passive-first security assessment of Spare Labs (bug bounty program) across in-scope assets: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com
- Identify and track unauthenticated vulnerabilities via GET/HEAD only (≤1 rps), no account creation, no data modification

## Important Details
- **Scope**: spare.com, sparelabs.com, platform.sparelabs.com, api.sparelabs.com, routing.sparelabs.com, forms.sparelabs.com
- **Exclusions**: ALL other subdomains of sparelabs.com and spare.com; all third-party services
- **Rules**: Passive-first only; secrets sha256 only; no raw secrets in commits
- **Multi-version envoy LB**: API behind envoy gateway serves different code versions across replicas (fast vs slow), causing flapping behavior on some routes — NOT a patch, replica-routing dependent
- **Patch/revert cycle**: Vendor deployed fix ~2026-08-20, then FULLY REVERTED fleet-wide by 2026-08-20 21:40 UTC — all prior bypasses restored
- **Canonical body hashes** for evidence rebuild:
  - SSO oracle response: `5b170be7b7829635753da63537ecfe9068be5eea0b0a6218ffd72b8770ae4414`
  - Org-key spare: `3099f1baba93ebf19434837bdd0552a72f110a262bd01528eb48e8ba71e0e8cd`
  - Regions body: `27d83f3c...` (751B with UAT region, `simulationsEnabled:true`)
  - Regions old: `fb9800acb09b65ec92591f4536e3ecfd08b8c3dba0d2ef9af3ed97047795c3fe`
- **GitHub pipeline**: scan-target misconfigured (gladiaio org instead of sparelabs); 0 code files scanned; no code-surface data available

## Work State
### Completed
- **SSO Oracle** (CONFIRMED SURVIVOR): `POST /v1/identity/workos/auth` — 10+ SSO tenants enumerated (spare.com, dart.org, translink.ca, mbta.com, saskatoon.ca, kingcounty.gov, winnipeg.ca, oakville.ca, cota.com, +2). Fleet-parity 7 hosts. State param reflected URL-encoded. redirect_uri dead (silently dropped). Staging enforces 401 confirming prod serves older code.
- **Org-Key Oracle** (FULLY REVERTED): `GET /v1/public/organizations/key/{key}` — 3-way oracle, 5 live orgs {spare,grt,dallas,winnipeg,hsr}, prod-only data, feature-flag differential (spare 5, winnipeg 4, hsr 3, grt 2, dallas 0), 22 candidates exhausted
- **Regions Bypass** (REVERTED ALIVE): `GET /v1/global/regions` — scheme-only Bearer bypass, 751B with 8 regions incl UAT, deterministic fast-replica split (8/8 fast replicas bypass, slow replicas 401). 200 omits ACAO while ACAC:true retains (partial CORS patch effect)
- **Organizations Bypass** (REVERTED ALIVE): `GET /v1/global/organizations` — zero-header read-only bypass, 200+11B `{"data":[]}`+ACAO+ACAC. POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE→401 (read-only confirmed). Write methods properly gated.
- **Engage Cases POST** (SURVIVOR): `POST /v1/public/engage/cases` — auth gate structurally ABSENT. Pipeline: validation→org-uuid→feature-flag→handler. Returns 403 ForbiddenError for known orgs (feature-flag gate, NOT auth gate). CORS reflected. PATCH/DELETE/PUT→401 (POST-only unauth).
- **Engage CaseForms POST** (SURVIVOR): `POST /v1/public/engage/caseForms` — formKey-existence oracle, 404 "Form was not found" handler-reached without 401
- **Engage CaseType/Form GET** (SURVIVOR): Spare org has "test" + "incident" caseTypeKeys; full schema disclosure (20 fields + 20 incident categories); formId extractable
- **UUID Oracle** (plural): `GET /v1/public/organizations/{id}` — 3-way discrimination (malformed→400, nil→404, valid→200), fully reverted post-patch
- **Singular Organization** (DEGRADED): `GET /v1/public/organization` — FLAPPING 2-way↔3-way across envoy replicas, downgraded to validation-leak-only
- **Terms Disclosure**: `GET /v1/public/terms` — currently 400+165B (demoted from reports, marked unstable)
- **CORS**: ACAO reflection dead on 401 responses on patched replicas; alive on public/200 responses and OPTIONS 204 preflight
- **Platform CSP Leak** (STABLE): `GET /platform.sparelabs.com/login` — CSP exposes admin-eam-app.vercel.app + admin-fixed-route-app.vercel.app (prod+staging) + Metabase + 9 cloud services
- **routing.sparelabs.com**: STABLE dead — envoy 404/0B all paths since 2026-08-07
- **UAT parity lost**: `api.uat.sparelabs.com` returns 401 on all routes; removed from prod fleet
- **Forms bundle regression chronic**: main.7f821c2b.js (sha256 `769f794a...`) contains ngrok/atlassian/metabase refs across 4+ rotations; CA→US data routing confirmed

### Active
- Ongoing monitoring of patch/revert stability across fleet replicas
- Canonical hashes established for evidence regeneration (~7 requests, ≤1 rps playbook works)

### Blocked
- GitHub code scan: reposcan-raw/sparelabs dir empty; scan-target misconfigured (gladiaio org); no code-surface data available
- Engage GET routes: flapping between OpenAPI validation (400) and router-level not-found (400) across envoy replicas — unreliable passive surface
- caseTypeKey enumeration: keys are admin-created with no public enumeration endpoint; BLOCKED without admin access

